# Accepted secret-scan findings: one fingerprint per line, with the comment lines directly above it.
# Entry format (the fingerprint is printed by `make secrets-scan`):
#   # <date of acceptance>: <reason>. Review by <review date, at most three months later>.
#   <commit>:<file>:<rule>:<line>      (history finding) or <file>:<rule>:<line> (working file)
# A real secret is never accepted: revoke and rotate it, then remove it from the history.
